lthy in production, so I rolled back to that. All three regions are now running it, health checks pass, and the error rate is down to 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** I opened SEV2 incident INC-0001 for checkout-api, which paged the on-call engineer. It describes the failure, the rollback and the next steps.\n\nThe release candidate for v2.3.1 also failed in staging but still went to production. The incident flags this so it gets looked at, and v2.3.1 shouldn't be redeployed until the root cause is found.", "type": "text"}]}]}